@startuml
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12

box "Local Environment / Edge" #LightYellow
participant "Camera + Python Script\n(GStreamer / KVS SDK)" as Cam
end box

box "AWS Ingestion & Processing" #LightCyan
participant "AWS Kinesis Video Streams\n(KVS)" as KVS
participant "AWS Rekognition\n(Stream Processor)" as Rek
participant "Amazon Kinesis Data Streams\n(KDS)" as KDS
end box

box "Logic & Notification" #LightCyan
participant "AWS Lambda\n(Python 3.12)" as Lambda
participant "Amazon DynamoDB\n(Alerts/State Table)" as DB
participant "Amazon S3" as S3
participant "Amazon SNS" as SNS
end box

actor "User / Administrator" as User

== Live Video Ingestion ==
Cam -> KVS: Transmits real-time video stream (RTSP)
activate KVS

== Artificial Intelligence Analysis ==
KVS -> Rek: Consumes live video stream
activate Rek
Rek -> Rek: Runs computer vision models\n(Person/Face/Moderation detection)
Rek -> KDS: Emits detection metadata (JSON with coordinates)
deactivate Rek
activate KDS

== Serverless Orchestration ==
KDS -> Lambda: Triggers execution with detection batch
activate Lambda

Lambda -> DB: Check recent alerts (Deduplication / Rate limiting)
activate DB
DB --> Lambda: Return last alert timestamp
deactivate DB

Lambda -> Lambda: Evaluates business logic\n(e.g., Is it an intruder during off-hours?)

alt If valid & non-duplicate alert is detected
    Lambda -> S3: Saves video frame/clip as evidence
    Lambda -> DB: Log alert event & update state (Active Alert)
    Lambda -> SNS: Publishes critical alert event
    activate SNS
    SNS -> User: Sends immediate notification (SMS / Email / Webhook Bot)
    deactivate SNS
end

deactivate Lambda
deactivate KDS
deactivate KVS
@enduml